  "details": "I wouldn't be surprised if this bug report gets closed, since this bug is a one-off, and the censorship system works as intended.\n\nI was creating a regional VRChat group. My description for the group has been messed up for the past few days, but I figured out how. It was a combination of situational words.\n\nThe original description of my text entry is in the screenshot (Seems like Canny isn't allowing it either, haha). However, after I saved, the description after for the group came out as:\n\n\"a group for vrchat users hor seside in nebraskac urrentr esidencyi sn otr equiredf ore ntryt ot heg roup'b utp referred\"\n\nLater figured out it was the combination of, what I later changed to \"who are residing\", and understandably, the censor misinterpreted that phrase and jumbled the whole sentence. Unlike in the VRChat client, the word(s) instead get replaced.",
